Upstream commit 3984925b660a (Bug 709768): clear list pointer to
avoid double free when a crafted PDF signature object has two
reference dicts (one specific field, one /All). Without the NULL,
the second free_char_list() call frees the stale pointer.

PATCH-FIX-UPSTREAM mupdf-709768-double-free.patch -- Bug 709768, boo#1285930 (CVE-2026-112036)
--- mupdf-1.28.6-source/source/pdf/pdf-xref.c.orig
+++ mupdf-1.28.6-source/source/pdf/pdf-xref.c
@@ -4180,6 +4180,7 @@
 	for (i = c->len-1; i >= 0; i--)
 		fz_free(ctx, c->list[i]);
 	fz_free(ctx, c->list);
+	c->list = NULL;
 	c->len = 0;
 	c->max = 0;
 }
